          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP706 Mitchell Ave [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Up to Red Deer for a few hours on a great fall afternoon and thought I might find more, but this ended up being my only cap of the day. My timing was such that I waited for the schoolkids to head in after lunch to keep the potential creepy factor to a minimum :)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TFTBC. &lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
