          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP706 - Mitchell Ave&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Out for another day of capping and caching with OBA, this time in Red Deer!! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; No one out playing nearby, so we had a quiet hunt, as short as it was.  We had to let Mr. Bad Ant back at home know we had found his avenue's Brass Cap! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_wink.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;  Quick find and we were on our way to the next one!! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; TFTCap!!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
